IMPORT prelude

-- Misuse of Drugs Act 1973 (2020 Revised Edition), Singapore Statutes Online, current version as at 01 Oct 2026.
-- Source: source/MDA1973.txt (extracted from source/MDA1973.pdf); the line references in the other modules are to that file.
--
-- The shared nouns, and nothing else: DECLARE only, no rules, no #EVAL.  Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Membership test: could a witness of ordinary competence testify to this fact, or does answering it require reading the Act?  Only the
-- first kind is a field here.  "The accused sold the thing" is a fact; "the accused trafficked" is a rule.  The CLASS of a drug (Class A,
-- B or C) is an input: it is read off the First Schedule, whose 140-odd named substances (Part 1), 20-odd (Part 2) and 20-odd (Part 3) are a
-- list of chemical names the encoding does not reproduce (NOTES.md section 2).
--
-- SCOPE: Parts 1, 2, 2A, 2B and 3 (the offences, the presumptions, the evidence rules, the powers and the punishments, and the Second
-- Schedule printed table in full); s 34(2) and s 53 and the provisions in Parts 4 to 7 that bear on a prosecution.  NOT encoded: the
-- administration of approved institutions and review committees (ss 34 to 39, 41 to 52), the DNA and photograph register (ss 40A to 40D), and
-- the regulation-making power (s 58); NOTES.md section 2 is the coverage table.

§ `Substances: what the thing is`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 2 'Class A drug', 'Class B drug', 'Class C drug'; First Schedule Parts 1, 2, 3"
DECLARE `Drug Class` IS ONE OF
    `Class A drug`
    `Class B drug`
    `Class C drug`
    `Not in any class`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 2 'controlled drug', 'controlled equipment, controlled material or controlled substance', 'psychoactive substance', 'excluded substance'; First, Third and Fifth Schedules"
DECLARE `Substance Facts` HAS
    `the thing is specified in Part 1, 2 or 3 of the First Schedule, or is anything that contains a substance or product so specified` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing is specified in the Third Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing has the capacity to have a psychoactive effect on an individual if the individual smokes, administers to himself or herself or otherwise consumes it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing is within a paragraph of Part 1 of the Fifth Schedule other than paragraph 4 (any controlled drug or controlled substance)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person asserting that the thing is an excluded substance has proved that on a balance of probabilities` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 2. Offences involving controlled drugs and substances`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 2 'traffic', 5(1), 5(2), 11F(1), 11F(2)"
DECLARE `Trafficking Facts` HAS
    `the accused sold, gave, administered, transported, sent, delivered or distributed the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused offered to sell, give, administer, transport, send, deliver or distribute the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused did, or offered to do, an act preparatory to or for the purpose of trafficking in the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused had the thing in his or her possession for the purpose of trafficking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's act was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 2 'manufacture', 6, 11G(1)"
DECLARE `Manufacture Facts` HAS
    `the accused produced the thing, or refined it or transformed one thing into another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's act was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 7, 11H(1)"
DECLARE `Import Export Facts` HAS
    `the accused imported the thing into Singapore or exported it from Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's act was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 8(a), 8(b), 11I(1)(a), 11I(1)(b); Fourth Schedule 'specified drugs'"
DECLARE `Possession Consumption Facts` HAS
    `the accused had the thing in his or her possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused smoked, administered to himself or herself or otherwise consumed the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the controlled drug is a specified drug within the Fourth Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's act was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 8A, 11J"
DECLARE `Overseas Consumption Facts` HAS
    `the accused is a citizen of Singapore or a permanent resident of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was found as a result of urine tests conducted under section 31(4)(b) to have consumed the drug or substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consumption took place outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 9, 11K(1)"
DECLARE `Paraphernalia Facts` HAS
    `the accused had in his or her possession a pipe, syringe, utensil, apparatus or other article` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the article was intended for the smoking, administration or consumption of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's possession was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 10"
DECLARE `Cultivation Facts` HAS
    `the accused cultivated a plant of the genus Cannabis` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused cultivated a plant of the species papaver somniferum` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused cultivated a plant of the genus erythroxylon from which cocaine can be extracted` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 10A(1) and (2)"
DECLARE `Controlled Equipment Facts` HAS
    `the accused manufactured controlled equipment, controlled material or a controlled substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused supplied it to another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused had it in his or her possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused imported it or exported it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knew or had reason to believe that it was to be used in or for the manufacture of a controlled drug in contravention of section 6` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it was the subject of a licence, permit or other authorisation issued under regulations made under section 10B` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11, 11L"
DECLARE `Premises Facts` HAS
    `the accused was the owner, tenant, occupier or person in charge of the place or premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused permitted, suffered or allowed the place or premises or part of it to be opened, kept or used for smoking, administration or consumption of the thing in contravention of section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused permitted, suffered or allowed the place or premises or part of it to be opened, kept or used for the unlawful trafficking in or the unlawful manufacturing of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11A, 11M"
DECLARE `Gathering Facts` HAS
    `there was a gathering of 2 or more persons in a place` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused arranged or planned the gathering` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knew that the thing was, or was to be, consumed in contravention of section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b), or unlawfully trafficked, at the gathering` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the gathering consists of a young person or a vulnerable person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is 21 years of age or older` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11B(1), 11B(2), 11B(4), 11B(5), 11N(1) to (6)"
DECLARE `Exposure Facts` HAS
    `the accused is 21 years of age or older` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was in possession of the thing or of drug paraphernalia` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knowingly or recklessly left it exposed in a place, or in a refrigerator, cupboard, cabinet, box, chest or other article that is not locked` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knew that a child below 16 years of age has, or is likely to have, access to the place or article` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused permitted a young person to smoke, administer or consume the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused did not take all reasonable steps to prevent a young person from smoking, administering or consuming the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused's possession was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that he or she had the psychoactive substance in his or her possession for a legitimate purpose other than human consumption` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11C, 11O"
DECLARE `Introduction Facts` HAS
    `the accused knew or had reason to believe that another person intends to procure the thing, and that his or her possession of it would not be authorised` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knew or had reason to believe that another person intends, without authorisation, to smoke, administer or consume the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused introduced that person to a person whom the accused knows or has reason to believe is trafficking in the thing and is likely to supply it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that he or she believed that the other person intended to procure the psychoactive substance for a legitimate purpose other than human consumption` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11D, 11P"
DECLARE `Instruction Facts` HAS
    `the accused taught or instructed another person to carry out, or provided him or her with information on carrying out, an activity mentioned in section 11D(1) or 11P(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused knew or had reason to believe that the other person intended to carry out the activity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused disseminated or published, or caused the dissemination or publication of, information on carrying out such an activity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the teaching, instruction, provision, dissemination or publication was authorised under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that it had a legitimate purpose related to the administration of justice, the investigation and prosecution of offences, or to science, medicine, education or art` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the activity is only smoking, administering or consuming a psychoactive substance, and not manufacture, trafficking, importing or exporting` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that he or she believed that the activity was for a legitimate purpose other than human consumption` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11E, 11Q"
DECLARE `Young Person Facts` HAS
    `the accused is 21 years of age or older` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused caused or procured a young person or a vulnerable person to commit the offence` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11F(6), 11G(3), 11H(5), 11I(4)"
DECLARE `Legitimate Purpose Facts` HAS
    `the accused proves that the purpose was a legitimate purpose other than human consumption` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 12, 13, 14"
DECLARE `Secondary Liability Facts` HAS
    `the accused abetted the commission of an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused attempted to commit an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused did an act preparatory to, or in furtherance of, the commission of an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused aided, abetted, counselled or procured the commission, in a place outside Singapore, of an offence punishable under a corresponding law in force in that place` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused did an act preparatory to, or in furtherance of, an act outside Singapore which if committed in Singapore would constitute an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused aided, abetted, counselled or procured the commission of an offence under this Act within Singapore, even though all or any of the acts were done outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence was committed by a body corporate with the consent or connivance of, or was attributable to any neglect on the part of, the accused as a director, manager, secretary or similar officer, or a person purporting to act as one` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Part 3. Presumptions and evidence`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 17"
DECLARE `Drug Quantity Facts` HAS
    `the weight of opium in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of morphine in the opium in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of morphine in the controlled drug, opium excluded, in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of diamorphine in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of cannabis in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of cannabis mixture in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of cannabis resin in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of cocaine in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of methamphetamine in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of ketamine in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `the weight of N,alpha-dimethyl-3,4-(methylenedioxy)phenethylamine, alpha-methyl-3,4-(methylenedioxy)phenethylamine and N-ethyl-alpha-methyl-3,4-(methylenedioxy)phenethylamine together in grammes` IS A NUMBER

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 17 to 22"
DECLARE `Presumption Facts` HAS
    `the accused is proved to have had the thing in his or her possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is proved to have had in his or her possession or custody or under his or her control anything containing the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is proved to have had in his or her possession or custody or under his or her control the keys of anything containing the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is proved to have had in his or her possession or custody or under his or her control the keys of a place or premises or part of them in which the thing is found` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is proved to have had in his or her possession or custody or under his or her control a document of title relating to the thing or another document intended for its delivery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that he or she did not have the thing in his or her possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that he or she did not know the nature of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves that his or her possession of the thing was not for the purpose of trafficking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `one of 2 or more persons with the knowledge and consent of the rest has the thing in his or her possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused never had physical possession of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 19, 20, 21, 22"
DECLARE `Place Presumption Facts` HAS
    `a pipe, syringe, utensil, apparatus or other article intended for smoking, administration or consumption of a controlled drug or psychoactive substance is found in the place or premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the place or premises is proved to be used for smoking, administering or consuming a controlled drug or psychoactive substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was found in, or escaping from, the place or premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing was found in a ship or aircraft` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing was found in a vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is the master or the captain of the ship or aircraft` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is the owner of the vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is the person in charge of the vehicle for the time being` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing was found in the urine of the accused as a result of both urine tests conducted under section 31(4)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contrary is proved` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 15, 16, 23, 31(6), 31A(4), 33(4AC), 33(4AD), 33A(3), 33A(4)"
DECLARE `Evidence Facts` HAS
    `the document purports to be issued by or on behalf of the government of a country outside Singapore and to state the terms of a corresponding law in force there` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prosecution produces the document or certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate purports to be signed by an analyst employed by the Health Sciences Authority or the Home Team Science and Technology Agency, or by a person the Minister has appointed by notification in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate purports to relate to a controlled drug, controlled substance or psychoactive substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate states the result of a urine test or hair test and is signed by an analyst employed by the Health Sciences Authority or a person the Minister has appointed by notification in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate purports to be signed by an officer authorised in writing by the Commissioner of Prisons and to relate to a person's previous admission to an approved institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate purports to be signed by the registrar for the subordinate military courts or for the Military Court of Appeal and to relate to a person's previous conviction by such a court` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contrary is proved` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 22A, 22B"
DECLARE `Psychoactive Proof Facts` HAS
    `the proceedings are for an offence under section 11F(1), 11G(1), 11H(1), 11I(1)(a) or (b), 11K(1), 11L(1), 11M(1), 11N(1) or (2), 11O(1), 11P(1) or (2) or 11Q(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the prosecution proves that the thing has the capacity to have a psychoactive effect on an individual if the individual smokes, administers to himself or herself or otherwise consumes it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person alleged to have committed the offence knows that the thing has the capacity to have a psychoactive effect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person alleged to have committed the offence did not believe, and had no reason to believe, that the thing is an excluded substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person asserts that the thing is an excluded substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person has proved on a balance of probabilities that the thing is an excluded substance` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 23(1) to (3)"
DECLARE `Informer Facts` HAS
    `the proceedings are civil or criminal proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the proceedings are before a court for an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the court, after full inquiry into the case, is satisfied that an informer wilfully made a material statement which he or she knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in proceedings other than for an offence under this Act, the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties without the disclosure of the name of an informer` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Parts 3 and 7. Powers, officers and the court`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 24, 25, 26, 31, 31A, 31B, 32"
DECLARE `Officer Role` IS ONE OF
    `an officer of the Bureau`
    `a police officer not below the rank of sergeant`
    `a police officer below the rank of sergeant`
    `a special police officer`
    `a senior officer of customs`
    `an officer of customs who is not a senior officer of customs`
    `an immigration officer`
    `a serving member of the Singapore Armed Forces appointed by the Minister as an enforcement officer`
    `the Director of the Central Narcotics Bureau`
    `some other person`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 24(1)"
DECLARE `Search Premises Facts` HAS
    `the officer reasonably suspects that there is to be found in the place or premises a controlled drug, controlled substance, psychoactive substance or article liable to seizure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the officer reasonably suspects that there is to be found in the place or premises a vehicle, autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft, unmanned vessel or component used in the commission of or in connection with an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the officer reasonably suspects that there is to be found in the place or premises a person who has committed or is reasonably suspected to have committed an offence under this Act or an arrestable offence under the regulations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the officer reasonably suspects that a thing found is a controlled drug, controlled substance or psychoactive substance, or an article liable to seizure` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 25(1) to (4)"
DECLARE `Arrest Facts` HAS
    `the person has committed an offence under this Act or an arrestable offence under the regulations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under this Act or an arrestable offence under the regulations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person to be searched is a woman` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the searcher is a woman` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 26(1)"
DECLARE `Search Vessel Facts` HAS
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train a controlled drug in contravention of this Act, a controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel a controlled drug or controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person is arriving in Singapore or about to depart from Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 30(1)(a) to (d)"
DECLARE `Obstruction Facts` HAS
    `the accused obstructed an officer of the Bureau, police officer, officer of customs or other public officer in the exercise of a power under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused failed to comply with a lawful requirement of such an officer in the execution of his or her duty under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused, without reasonable excuse, failed to furnish information in his or her possession required by such an officer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused furnished to such an officer information which he or she knew or had reason to believe to be false` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 31, 31A, 31B"
DECLARE `Specimen Facts` HAS
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Director has ordered a relevant person to present himself or herself and to provide a specimen, to ensure the person is no longer a drug addict` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to provide the specimen within the time required` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to comply with the Director's order` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the specimen of urine was divided into 3 parts and a preliminary urine test was conducted on one part` IS A BOOLEAN
    `each of the remaining 2 parts was marked and sealed and a urine test was conducted on each part by a different person, being an analyst of the Health Sciences Authority or a person appointed by the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the preliminary urine test was negative for controlled drugs and psychoactive substances` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 33(3A), 33(3B), 33(3C), 33(3D), 33(4), 33(4AA), 33(4AB), 33(4A), 33(4B), 33(4C), 33(5), 33A"
DECLARE `Antecedent Facts` HAS
    `the offence was committed on or after 1 April 2019` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(a) or 11I(1)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(b), 11I(1)(b), 31(2) or 31A(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(b) or 31(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 11I(1)(b) or 31A(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous admission under section 34(2) to an approved institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction for consumption of a controlled drug or psychoactive substance under section 34 of the Singapore Armed Forces Act 1972` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 5(1), 7, 11F(1) or 11H(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is 21 years of age or older` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended recipient of the controlled drug is a young person or a vulnerable person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the gathering consists of a young person or a vulnerable person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of the accused's previous admissions` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for consumption of a specified drug under section 8(b)` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for failure to provide a urine specimen under section 31(2)` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for failure to provide a hair specimen under section 31A(2)` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for consumption of a specified drug under section 34 of the Singapore Armed Forces Act 1972` IS A NUMBER
    `the accused has been convicted under section 33A(1), (1A) or (1B)` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 33B(1) to (4)"
DECLARE `Section 33B Facts` HAS
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 53"
DECLARE `Court Facts` HAS
    `the punishment in question is the punishment of death` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `The Second Schedule: offences punishable on conviction`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule, columns 3 to 7; s 33(1) to (3)"
DECLARE `Schedule Column` IS ONE OF
    `Third to fifth columns: by the class of drug`
    `Sixth column: a specified drug or quantity`
    `Seventh column: general`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule, sixth column; s 33(2)(b)"
DECLARE `Specified Quantity Of` IS ONE OF
    `Nothing specified`
    `Opium`
    `Morphine in a controlled drug, opium excluded`
    `Diamorphine`
    `Cocaine`
    `Cannabis`
    `Cannabis mixture`
    `Cannabis resin`
    `Methamphetamine`
    `Manufacture of morphine or a salt, ester or salt of ester of morphine`
    `Manufacture of diamorphine or a salt of diamorphine`
    `Manufacture of cocaine or a salt of cocaine`
    `Manufacture of methamphetamine or a salt of methamphetamine`

-- The Schedule's own words: "Maximum 20 years and 15 strokes", "Minimum 5 years and 5 strokes", "Maximum 30 years or imprisonment for life and 15
-- strokes", "Death", "Maximum 10 years or $20,000 or both", "Maximum 20 years or $40,000 or both / Minimum 3 years or $5,000 or both".  Imprisonment is
-- in months so that "12 months" and "6 months" are exact.  A figure of 0 means "none printed", and 'the ... may be imposed in the alternative' is TRUE
-- where the Schedule says "or ... or both" and FALSE where it says "and".
@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule; s 33(3) (a reference to a period gives the maximum or minimum term, to a sum the maximum or minimum fine, to strokes the number of strokes)"
DECLARE `Punishment` HAS
    `the punishment is death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `imprisonment for life is a possible sentence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the maximum imprisonment in months` IS A NUMBER
    `the minimum imprisonment in months` IS A NUMBER
    `the maximum fine in dollars` IS A NUMBER
    `the minimum fine in dollars` IS A NUMBER
    `the minimum strokes of the cane` IS A NUMBER
    `the maximum strokes of the cane` IS A NUMBER
    `imprisonment, fine or both may be imposed in the alternative` IS A BOOLEAN

-- A band is "not less than 330 grammes and not more than 500 grammes" (both ends inclusive), "more than 500 grammes" (exclusive, no upper end) or
-- "less than 330 grammes" (no lower end, exclusive).  0 means no bound: every printed bound is positive.  An opium band adds the morphine the opium
-- contains.  A band is met only by a quantity greater than 0, so "less than 330 grammes of cannabis" is not met by a case with no cannabis in it.
@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule, sixth column"
DECLARE `Quantity Band` HAS
    `lower bound in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `lower bound is inclusive` IS A BOOLEAN
    `upper bound in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `upper bound is inclusive` IS A BOOLEAN
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound in grammes` IS A NUMBER
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound is inclusive` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule"
DECLARE `Second Schedule Row` HAS
    `section creating the offence` IS A STRING
    `item` IS A STRING
    `general nature of the offence` IS A STRING
    `column` IS A `Schedule Column`
    `class of drug` IS A `Drug Class`
    `quantity of` IS A `Specified Quantity Of`
    `quantity band` IS A `Quantity Band`
    `the row is residual: it applies only where no more specific row of the same section applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the punishment is subject to section 33(3B)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `punishment` IS A `Punishment`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, Second Schedule, sixth column; s 33(2)(b)"
DECLARE `Scheduled Quantity Facts` HAS
    `the drug manufactured is morphine or a salt, ester or salt of ester of morphine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the drug manufactured is diamorphine or a salt of diamorphine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the drug manufactured is cocaine or a salt of cocaine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the drug manufactured is methamphetamine or a salt of methamphetamine` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `The punishments the sections themselves state`

-- Most offences outside the Second Schedule carry their punishment in the section.  Each has a base band and, for many, a repeat band (for a
-- person with a previous conviction of the kind the row names) and an enhanced band (an offender 21 or older, an intended recipient who is a
-- young person or a vulnerable person, and so on).  The caller says which bands the facts engage; the row says what each band is.
@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 11A(1), 11B(3) and (3A), 11C(2) and (2A), 11D(3) to (4B), 11F(3) to (5), 11G(2), 11H(2) to (4), 11I(2) and (3), 11K(2), 11L(2), 11M(2) and (3), 11N(3) and (4), 11O(2) and (3), 11P(3) to (6), 11Q(2), 13, 34A(2), 33(3A) to (3D), 33(4) to (4C), 33A"
DECLARE `Punishment Band` IS ONE OF
    `Base band`
    `Repeat band`
    `Enhanced band`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, the sections named in each row"
DECLARE `Section Punishment Row` HAS
    `offence` IS A STRING
    `band` IS A `Punishment Band`
    `provision that states the punishment` IS A STRING
    `what engages the band` IS A STRING
    `punishment` IS A `Punishment`

§ `Consumption offences and the death penalty`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 33(3A), 33(4), 33(4AA), 33(4AB), 33A(1), (1A), (1B), (2)"
DECLARE `Consumption Offence` IS ONE OF
    `Consumption of a specified drug (section 8(b)(ii))`
    `Consumption of another controlled drug (section 8(b)(i))`
    `Failure to provide a urine specimen (section 31(2))`
    `Failure to provide a hair specimen (section 31A(2))`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, s 33B(1)(a) and (b)"
DECLARE `Death Penalty Outcome` IS ONE OF
    `The sentence of death stands`
    `The court may impose imprisonment for life and not fewer than 15 strokes of the cane instead (section 33B(1)(a))`
    `The court must impose imprisonment for life instead (section 33B(1)(b))`

§ `Forfeiture`

@ref "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973, ss 27(3), 27(4), 28(1) to (4)"
DECLARE `Forfeiture Facts` HAS
    `it is proved to the satisfaction of a court that an offence under this Act has been committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the drug, substance or article was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is no prosecution with regard to the drug, substance or article seized` IS A BOOLEAN
    `one month has expired from the date of the seizure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a claim to it was made before that date in the prescribed manner` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person has been convicted of an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel, or a component, has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the vehicle, autonomous vehicle or a component has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Public Prosecutor applies for the order` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the ship, hovercraft or unmanned vessel is of more than 200 tons net, or the aircraft or unmanned aircraft belongs to a person carrying on a regular passenger service to and from Singapore by means of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner establishes that it was unlawfully in the possession of another person without the owner's consent` IS A BOOLEAN
